2 CONT Gustaf Adolf (son of Claes, Tab. 3), born 1793-09-25 in Nyköping. Shipwrecked at the army fleet's Sveaborgs injuries 1803-11-01. Medelstyrman at the very least. 1804-06-29. Chief of command at Gothenburg station 1831-01-14. Died 1
2 CONC 834-12-08 on Nya Nyavet in Gothenburg in cholera and closed the field. Married 1821-11-10 with Christina Lindberg , born 1789-03-10, dead 1831-02-11.
