1 NAME Carl Torsten /Blix/
2 GIVN Carl Torsten
2 _MARNM Blix
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 APR 1854
2 ADDR
3 CITY Lyrestad
3 STAE Västra Götaland County
3 POST 548 73
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 15 FEB 1925
1 OCCU Häradshövding
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Carl Thorsten Blix. 
2 CONT
2 CONT F. i Lyrestad, Skarab. län, i85427/4. Stud. i Upps.  72; ex. till rätteg.-verk. 76. Vice häradsh. 80; adj.  led. i »Svea hofr. S9—91; häradshöfding i Jämtlands  norra domsaga 90. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Verksam i Jämtland,(fullmakt 18 april 1890) 1890-1904
2 CONT
2 CONT  adjungerade ledamot Svea hovrätt 1889-1891
2 CONT
2 CONT  d. 7 mars 1924 beviljat häradshövdingen i Västra Värends domsaga Carl Torsten Blix avsked från häradshövdingämbetet fr. o. m. d. 27 april 1924
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT In the 1880 census, Torsten`s partner (Emma) was living with her parents. In October 1888, she left home and moved to Östersund. In 1889, at age 20, she returned home and a few weeks later, in July, she had a son. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Carl Hilding (Carl Torsten and Emma`s son) is listed in the Järvsö household records with the last name '''Torstensson'''. This was a patronym, which would make his biological father's first name '''Torsten'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Emma and Carl Torsten both lived in Østersund in the year 1888 and 1889, and lived closed to each other. 
