3 CITY Halmstad
3 STAE Halland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Kapellan i Torup i Göteborg Stift/ Assistant minister in Torup in Gøteborg diocese
1 TITL Kapellan
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1717: "1717 bor Pehr Ohlsson besökares änka i gården med rätt många andra: Där bodde ”sal Austrenii änka, fattig och sängliggsam”. Hon bör vara identisk med kyrkoherden i Länghem Johannes Olai Austrenii änka Britta
2 CONC  Kiällersdotter Berg, som 1707 ägde östra hälften av 1.14–15 och 1698 var cautionist för Assmund Nilssons änka Margareta Ambjörnsdotter. Där bodde också utfattige föravskedade sergeanten Carl Notin med sin hustru Ingrid Mårtensdot
2 CONC ter och skräddaren Erik Ahlberg ”av ringa villkor” med sin hustru Stina Ubeck, '''gesällen Anders Wetterberg''' och läregossarna Petter Smitt och Petter Ahlgren. " ''Första roten, tomt 1.9, Kvarteret Idogheten, Trettonde roten 163
2 CONC 7–57, Sjätte roten 1657–7, Vallgatans södra sida'' [http://www.gbgtomter.se/Rote_1/1.9.pdf]
2 CONT
2 CONT Kappelan i Torup, Göteborgs stift.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.kiermeet.dk/Kiermeet/US_Pages/Kj%C3%A6rulf%20Studies%20-20060109.pdf http://www.klarskov.org/humble/KjaerulfskeStudier.pdf opdateret udgave
2 CONT
2 CONT Anden kilde: 12. Niels Kjerrulff, born 7. Oct. 1661, at the university in Lund 1684, minister in Wessige 1693, died 22. Jan. 1735. Married first to Ingierd Santesson from Bøkhult in Långaryd, (daughter of regiment quartermaster Sa
2 CONC nte Pehrsson and Katrina Gyllensten), married second 1711 to Johanna Holtzberg, born 1688, died 1735, daughter of minister Lars H. in Knärød. (her older sister Benedicta was married to minister Niels Olufsen Kjerrulf in Weinge). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: a. Elsa Katarina Kjerrulff, born 5. March 1698, died 1771, married 1721 to Anders Wetterberg, born 1693, died 2. June 1743, assistant minister in Torup in Gøteborg diocese.
2 CONT
2 CONT b. Marta Susanna Kjerrulff, born 13. Dec. 1700, married to a non-commissioned officer Grønvall.
2 CONT
2 CONT c. Engela Helena Kjerrulff, born 4. Aug. 1713, died 17 . . , married 1736 to Erik Panlin, died 9. Feb. 1755, merchant in Varberg. (their daughter was as mentioned page 66 married to minister Johan Christoffer Kjerrulff). 
2 CONT
2 CONT d. Morten Fredrik Kjerrulff, born 30. Aug. 1717, died 2. May 1785. Volunteer at Skåne cavalry 1737, non-commissioned officer in Adlerfeld’s regiment 1741, Adjutant in Willebrandsk regiment 1743, lieutenant 1749, captain 1750. Made
2 CONC  major 1768 and was promoted at his retirement 1784 to light colonel, knight of S. O. Was 12. Sep. 1772 rose to nobility with the name Kjerrulff von Wolffen. Was owner of Hellerø by Borås. Married 1754 to Marie Elisabet Browald, b
2 CONC orn 7. July 1725, died 17. Nov. 1798, daughter of colonel Isak B. and Ingela Hammar.  Children: 1) Ingela Johanna Kjerrulff von Wolffen, born 19. March 1756, died 1787, married 1786 to Erland Kafle (adl.1
2 CONT  Nr. 70), born 7. Febr. 1753, died 1796, captain in Vestgøta cavalry. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Torup är en tätort i Torups distrikt i Hylte kommun i Hallands län och kyrkbyn i Torups socken i Halland. Orten har gamla anor, belägen mellan Sjögårdssjön och den mindre Prästasjön. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Kapellan Anders Wetterberg Peterson'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Född:	1693 Varberg, Halland, Sweden
2 CONT * Död:	03 Januari 1743 (50) Halmstad, Torup, Halland, Sweden
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son till Peter Wetterberg 
2 CONT * Make till Elisabeth Catharina Kjerrulf 
2 CONT * Fader till Johanna Wetterberg; Petter Wetterberg; Susanna Brigitta Wetterberg; Nicolaus Wetterberg; Marta Sanna Wetterberg; Marten Fredrik Wetterberg och Anna Elisabeth Wetterberg 
2 CONT * Bror till Bengt Wetterberg; Sven Wetterberg och Bengta Wetterberg 
2 CONT ----
