2 CONT http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Af_Bjerk%C3%A9n_nr_1995#TAB_8
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pehr_af_Bjerk%C3%A9n Pehr af Bjerkén]''' was regarded as the finest surgeon in Sweden of his time. His eye was as steady as his hand. While performing in numerous positions during the course of his
2 CONC  career, he was also a fellow of the Medical Society of London, Medical Society of Montpellier, the Royal Swedish Academy of Sciences and Pro Patria. During his final years, he notably succumbed to the good life, particularly to t
2 CONC he merits of Bacchi. It is said that he did no longer trust his hands before having emptied several glasses, and only then went on to perform surgery. Still, he managed numerous spectacular courses of treatments and there was no e
2 CONC nd to the stream of ill people who set their hopes onto Pehr to save them.
2 CONT
2 CONT * * 1765-01-02
2 CONT * ~ 1765-01-03 Stockholm, Klara
2 CONT * 1779 Student, Uppsala
2 CONT * 1785 [http://www.ne.se/medikofilen Medikofilen]
2 CONT * 1787 Disp. pro exercitio. ''Museum Naturalium Academiæ Upsaliensis,'' præsidium [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carl_Peter_Thunberg C P Thunberg]
2 CONT * 1788 Fältskär och Sjukhus-läkare, Göteborg (chirurgiæ studiosus)
2 CONT * 1789 Fältskär och Sjukhus-läkare, Finland (chirurgiæ studiosus)
2 CONT * 1792 Medicine examen
2 CONT * 1793 Disputation pro gradu medico: ''febris puerperalis''
2 CONT * 1793 London, præsidium [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henry_Cline Henry Cline] & [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Hunter_%28surgeon%29 John Hunter]. “House surgeon”, St Thomas & Guy’s hospitals
2 CONT * 1797 Läkare-beställningen vid Veneriska Kurinrättningen
2 CONT * 1798 Ioo: Brita Catharina Lindh (Brita Kat. Lindh)
2 CONT * 1802 af Kungens 1:ste [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Livmedikus LifMedicus]
2 CONT * 1805 Förste [http://www.ne.se/f%C3%A4ltl%C3%A4kare FältLäkare], Österbotten
2 CONT * Regim.-Läkare, [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Life_Guards_%28Swedish_Army%29 Svea Lifgarde]
2 CONT * 1808 Förste FältMedikus
2 CONT * 1808 Riddare af Wasa-Orden, [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_Vasa K. Wasa O].
2 CONT * 1809 Öfver[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feldsher Fältskär], [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serafimerlasarettet Kungliga Seraphimer Lazarettet] (chirugiæ magister)
2 CONT * 1809 [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Royal_Swedish_Academy_of_Sciences LVA], No. 337. Kungliga Vetenskapsakademien [Royal Swedish Academy of Sciences]
2 CONT * 1810 Assessor, [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collegium_medicum Collegium medicum]
2 CONT * 1810 Орден Святого Владимира, [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_St._Vladimir Order of St. Vladimir]
2 CONT * 1811 IIoo: Sophia Christina Wetterquist (Sof. Kr. Wutterqvist)
2 CONT * 1812 Öfver-FältLäkare
2 CONT * 1814 [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Order_of_the_Polar_Star RNO], Nordstjärneorden [Order of the Polar Star]
2 CONT * 1817 Brigad-Läkare
2 CONT * † 1818-02-24
