1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Carl Gustaf af Bjerkén'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * * 1767-06-17
2 CONT * ~ 1767-06-19 Stockholm, Klara
2 CONT * Was a vicar in Stora Dala, Westergöthland
2 CONT * Student, magister in Uppsala
2 CONT * oo 1800 with his cousin, Johanna Fredrica af Bjekén (* 1767-10-20 in Finland † 1857-11-12 Stenåsen), in her 2nd marriage.
2 CONT
