2 NICK Karl Hilding Torstensson
1 NAME Carl Hilding Torstensson Engman (Blix)
1 SEX M
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Oslo
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 JUL 1889
2 ADDR
3 STAE Sverige i Ferila
3 CTRY Gevleborg
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1972
1 OCCU Tailor/Skredder
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Research Notes: Though his last name at birth was Jernström, he is listed in the Järvsö household records with the last name Torstensson. This was a patronym, which would make his biological father's first name Tor
2 CONC sten. After his mother's marriage, Karl Hilding took the last name Engman. Karl Hilding had 2 sons, one named after his step-father Lars and one after his biological father Torsten. Torsten died as a child.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes on his Father:  It has been well established that his biological fathers name was Torsten and lived in Østersund in the years 1888 and 1889. We know for a fact that his mother became pregnant while living in Østersu
2 CONC nd, Sweden in 1888. The only man born 1850-1865 with the name Torsten in Østersund is Carl Torsten Blix.
2 CONT
2 CONT BIO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Hilding Engman was born in Jämtland, Sweden. He was born to Emma Augusta Jernström, who was 20 at the time of his birth. She later married, and Carl took his stepfather's name, Engman. Carl became a tailor and in his 30s he m
2 CONC oved to Norway where he also married Inga. Carl Hilding had a tailor shop in Oslo, Norway. It has been said that Carl Hilding had the King of Norway as customer in his shop.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the 1890 census, he is living with his mother and her father. His mother was not married at the time of his birth. In 1900, he is living with his mother, her husband, and three brothers. In the 1910 census, he is listed as a ta
2 CONC ilor's apprentice. In 1922, he is listed in the emigrant records as moved to to Oslo area in Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1910 census, Yg[1] Engman, Lars, f. 1866 i Järvsö Gävleborgs län, Skräddarmästare (master tailor) Jernström, Emma, f. 1868 i Järvsö Gävleborgs län Karl Hilding, f. 1889 i Järvsö Gävleborgs län, Skrädderibiträde (assistant tailor) 
2 CONC Arvid Laurentius, f. 1895 i Färila Gävleborgs län Erik Ivar, f. 1898 i Färila Gävleborgs län Verner Cyrillus, f. 1899 i Färila Gävleborgs län
2 CONT
2 CONT From the 1910 census:  Namn Karl Hilding Hemförsamling Färila Hemort Yg Kontrakt Hels. Vestr. Öfr. Län Gävleborg Födelseår 1889 Födelseförsamling Järvsö Gävleborgs län Yrke Skrädderibiträde Civilstånd Ogift Kön Man Familjeställnin
2 CONC g s. Famstkod Barn From the emigration records (translated): Engman, Karl Hilding Skräddare (man) born 21/7 1889. Emigrated 10/7 1922 from Yg 1, Färila, Gävleborgs county (Hälsingland) to Oslo fylke, Norway.
